## Key Results

### Association Rule Mining

| Rule | Support | Confidence | Lift |
|---|---|---|---|
| Youth Allowance → JobSeeker Payment | 0.18 | 0.81 | 1.25 |
| Carer Payment → Disability Support Pension | 0.16 | 0.85 | 1.35 |
| Family Tax Benefit B + Parenting Payment Single → Commonwealth Rent Assistance | 0.14 | 0.79 | 1.30 |

### Logistic Regression

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Training Accuracy | 93.3% |
| Test Accuracy | 93.3% |
| AUC (ROC Curve) | ~0.83 |
| Pseudo R-squared | ~0.32 |
| Most Significant Predictor | Youth Allowance (student/apprentice) |
| Negative Predictor | Age Pension |

